   "notes_en": "Every role uses HuTian's existing Codex worker, gpt-6.1-sol at effort high, the same model and effort as CX-sol for a paired comparison of whether RW with Codex can beat a single Codex agent. The Codex roles use the project's own Codex login directly (HuTian's HT_CODEX_AUTH_FILE, not through codex-api: HuTian's mandatory proxy admits only the official endpoints): by default `codex-jack-rw` of the `codex-jack` account (sharing the allowance with the conditions that use `codex-jack` through codex-api), or `codex-jacques-rw` when chosen per run (sharing the allowance with the judges); the judges use `codex-jacques`. RW-sol can run at the same time as CX-sol, AS-sol and EVO-sol, which use `codex-jack` through codex-api, and they only share the account's usage allowance (preflight prints a note when a batch holds both); RW-sol and the Codex roles of RW-mixed read the same login file, and HuTian's own lock serialises their refreshes. RW-astra and a mixed variant are not added for now.",
